## Next Steps for Deployment
To start collecting Speed Insights data:
1. Enable Speed Insights in your Vercel dashboard (Project Settings → Speed Insights)
2. Deploy the application to Vercel
3. After deployment, Speed Insights will automatically start tracking web vitals
4. View performance metrics in the Vercel dashboard

## Technical Notes
- The Speed Insights component is lightweight and automatically tracks Core Web Vitals
- Data collection only begins after enabling Speed Insights in the Vercel dashboard
- The component uses the `/_vercel/speed-insights/*` route for data reporting
- No additional configuration required for basic usage
- Compatible with Next.js 16.2.1 (current project version)
